<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 250 mln guilders 11-year bond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 250 mln guilders 11-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    15.JAN.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.34    PAY DATE  L 23.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.666    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    32.5 BP   SELL CONC  1.675 PCT PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED SEPT 2007 AND APRIL 2010 DSLS</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
